    UI --> ApiClient
    ApiClient -->|HTTP / JSON with Bearer JWT| Server
    Server --> Middlewares --> Routes --> Controllers
    Controllers --> ServiceLayer
    
    OAuthSvc <-->|OAuth2 Token Exchange| GoogleAuth
    GmailSvc <-->|Fetch Messages & Details| GoogleGmail
    CalSvc <-->|Fetch Primary Calendar Events| GoogleCalendar
    AutoSyncSvc --> GmailSvc
    AutoSyncSvc --> CalSvc
    AutoSyncSvc --> AISvc
    AutoSyncSvc --> ReminderSvc

    AISvc <-->|LLM Prompting (LLM_API_KEY)| GeminiAPI
    AssistantSvc <-->|LLM Chat & Grounded Context| GeminiAPI
    
    ServiceLayer <-->|Service Role Admin Queries| SupaClient
    SupaClient --> RLS --> Tables

